Scope clarification:

This license covers only the original work in this repository — the patch
scripts, the Frida hook code, the README and documentation files, and the
build automation. It does NOT cover:

  - The Even Realities Android app (com.even.sg) or any of its libraries
    (libapp.so, libeven.so, etc.). Those remain the property of Even Realities
    and are not redistributed by this repository.

  - frida-gadget (libfrida-gadget.so) — see https://github.com/frida/frida
    (wxWindows Library License or LGPL, depending on version).

  - APKEditor and uber-apk-signer — please refer to their own licenses on
    their respective project repos.

The end user is expected to obtain their own legitimately-installed copy of
the Even Realities app and supply the third-party tools themselves; this
repository ships the recipe, not the dependencies.
